<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Afrikander Lease yr shr halves.</title>
<headline>Afrikander Lease yr shr halves.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 0.3	   vs 0.6</p>
<p>    After tax profit	0.02	  vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.02	  vs 0.06</p>
<p>    Tax			 nil	   vs 0.02</p>
<p>    Sundry expenditure    0.10	  vs 0.06</p>
<p>Royalties from Vaal Reefs Exploration and Mining Co Ltd: gold and uranium</p>
<p>				  0.13	  vs 0.13</p>
<p>Full name: Afrikander Lease Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said although the company made a profit, this was absorbed in providing for rehabilitation costs and a minimum royalty was paid.</p>
<p>The company's main block of mining rights is leased to Vaal Reefs for the mining and treatment of the uranium reserves. It has also granted Vaal Reefs the right to exploit gold-bearing ore.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
